{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他以前怕争取磨掉那份亲近，想退回安宁，可只退回来，妨碍那种生活的事仍会照旧。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他把对那种生活的牵挂带进眼前的事里，发现自己做的事也在替它争取，旧愿反而近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"旧愿近了\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道再怎么卖力，也未必能让那种生活回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"生活回来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他做事时会留意那份亲近有没有被冷落，不再只数自己出了多少力。\",\n      \"key\": \"有没有被冷落\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"肩上的责任没让他把那份向往压下去，想到它反而更有劲往前。\",\n      \"key\": \"更有劲往前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"那种生活还没回来，可走过怀疑和疲惫，他仍记得从前的快乐，也重新尝到那份难得的欢喜。\",\n      \"key\": \"难得的欢喜\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道自己还会累，真要付出代价时，也可能想退回安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"付出代价\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"text\": \"那股非得证明自己的劲头松下来，想护住那种生活的念头却还清楚地留着。\",\n      \"key\": \"证明自己的劲头\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R66\", \"R67\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\", \"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写、合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧愿从退回去保护变成行动理由的关键变化。把R67并入R68的具体因果，说明只退回来也挡不住妨碍那种生活的事，删去重复的袖手旁观判断。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\", \"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分、改写\",\n      \"why\": \"分别保留努力不保证实现愿望，以及行动时要留意是否冷落所爱。把抽象的价值判断改成具体的做事标准，避免重复S07-3已经说过的受损恐惧。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并、改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留责任不再使他压下向往、这份向往反而给行动力量的变化，删去整齐的自我许可宣言。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\", \"R75\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并、改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧日快乐重新回来、经历怀疑和疲惫后知道它来之不易，以及心愿未成也不否定从前真实得到的快乐。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\", \"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把努力结果未知并入S13-3，把生活尚未实现并入S13-6，保留现实的不确定性，删去重复的结局概括。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R74\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留未来仍会疲惫、想到代价可能想退回安宁的风险，删去两种渴望仍然冲突的哲理式补充。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-8\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写、补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再反复证明自己该往前的变化，同时补上催逼松开后仍清楚留着的保护愿望，解释末尾由低处轻声转向孤悬明亮的收束。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "adb0ea68-1ad5-4f61-9e02-b66088774ad9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T233412589141Z", "elapsed_seconds": 185.671, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:37:18.284450+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "017f5618f0e11176af2fe950c40a1a7e806733ab27817bcbb4e8b3d475f8528f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156d